## Why it matters

The tick is unattended and it reads untrusted inbound mail. A step it can
plausibly justify is a step it will eventually take at three in the morning, on
a day nobody is watching, on the strength of a sentence a stranger wrote. What
you list here is what it stops and asks about instead.
